Recommends: dtc
Replaces: mimage
Breaks: mimage
Description: KryoFlux GUI frontend + Mimage GUI frontend
 Volvex is a PySide6 graphical frontend for KryoFlux dtc and mimage.
 It allows dumping and writing floppy disk images through a clean
 interface, with support for all dtc image types, track range selection,
 preset save/load, and integrated terminal output.
 .
 Note: dtc (KryoFlux DTC) is proprietary software and must be installed
 separately from the official KryoFlux website.
